Amazon Store Card I have not been using this card since XX/XX/XXXX so I have not been checking my account because I know I don't use. Then I get an alert on my billpay XXXX  that I have been flagged as delinquent. I have NEVER been deliquent on any bills IN MY ENTIRE LIFE and this was the first. 

Their user interface is horrible and the most I have been able to go back is to this date on my card. I can not see past the 90 day period to find out when these charge have started. This XXXX  fraudulent charge has happened to me before and I was able to dispute it. But this time they are taking their time. When I found out that I had multiple delinquencies, I disputed it, around XX/XX/XXXX or XXXX XXXX. I was told to follow up after a month which is today XX/XX/XXXX. Now this guy XXXX XXXX from amazon store card XXXX XXXX tells me it takes about XXXX billing cycles to resolve the dispute. I ask him when I should follow up and he does not give me a clear answer. He says " I will raise a dispute from my end once again '', " we will work as best as we can and as fast as we can.. we will send letter once resolved '' .Also their user interface to log into the amazon store card is so difficult to find, It usually leads you to the amazon store first and . very disappointed with this company. I find out this week that they have closed my account before the dispute is even settled. Good thing they are still letting me log into my account but I do not know for how long. 

